==================================================

google.png, 2.0x/google.png, 3.0x/google.png
--------------------------------------------
Content: the official Google "G" logo (standard color, 18/36/54 px density
variants), used only on the "Continue with Google" sign-in control.

Provenance: extracted verbatim from the Google Sign-In SDK for iOS
(GoogleSignIn-iOS, GoogleSignIn/Sources/Resources/google.png and @2x/@3x).
The SDK is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see
