Trademarks: the Google name, logo, and the "G" mark are trademarks of Google
LLC. Apache-2.0 grants no trademark rights (Section 6). Use is governed by the
Sign in with Google Branding Guidelines:
https://developers.google.com/identity/branding-guidelines

Requirements honored by this app: the assets are bundled unmodified for brand
compliance. The current sign-in screen does not render them (it uses full-width
text buttons), so the Google branding requirements apply only if/when the
logo-only control is reintroduced.

apple_logo_only.svg
-------------------
