square + black Apple logo), used only on the logo-only "Sign in with Apple"
control.

Provenance: extracted verbatim (SHA-256 7ee1bc1706bc228f37a937de914e2ebe
1605aebba3c35f11c3963087573fc11f) from Apple's Sign in with Apple Logo download
(https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/design/resources/download/Logo-Sign-in-with-Apple.dmg,
"Sign in with Apple - Logo Only/SVG/"). Distributed under the Apple Developer
Artwork License Agreement for Sign in with Apple.

Trademarks: the Apple logo and "Sign in with Apple" are trademarks of Apple
Inc. Use is governed by the Human Interface Guidelines "Creating a custom Sign
in with Apple button" (logo-only) rules.

Requirements honored by this app: the artwork is bundled unmodified at a 1:1
aspect ratio (no crop, no added padding, no re-drawn logo). The current sign-in
screen does not render it; if the logo-only control is reintroduced, it would
only be shown on iOS/macOS where the native Sign in with Apple flow is available.
